        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to lead your pharma company or biotech startup to success?</strong> <br>The <strong>Pharma R&amp;D Pipeline Manager</strong> Game is a round-based <strong>educational business and management simulation</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the shoes of a Pharma R&amp;D CEO!</strong> Players will immerse themselves in the dynamic <strong>management world of pharmaceutical research &amp; development</strong>, navigating the challenging journey <strong>from initial discovery through clinical development to final regulatory approval</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead &amp; Motivate:</strong> the player leads the most important research &amp; development departments and assembles a strong and motivating management team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do business deals:</strong> The player needs to close transformative business deals to strategically enhance the companies project portfolio/pipeline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make pipeline decisions:</strong> the player needs to optimize the project pipeline by making strategic project and pipeline decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ensure financing:</strong> ensure the financing of your company</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain valuable insights into the <strong>success probabilities of R&amp;D phases</strong>, navigate <strong>business development strategies</strong>, and overcome <strong>financial challenges</strong>. You’ll also learn how <strong>leadership skills</strong> and a strong <strong>organizational culture</strong> are vital for fostering <strong>employee engagement</strong>, boosting <strong>organizational effectiveness</strong>, and achieving overall success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every dashboard you can use the interactive help system to get additional information on drug development, finance and key technical terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun, play and learn!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to lead your pharma company or biotech startup to success?</strong> <br>The <strong>Pharma R&amp;D Pipeline Manager</strong> Game is a round-based <strong>educational business and management simulation</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the shoes of a Pharma R&amp;D CEO!</strong> Players will immerse themselves in the dynamic <strong>management world of pharmaceutical research &amp; development</strong>, navigating the challenging journey <strong>from initial discovery through clinical development to final regulatory approval</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead &amp; Motivate:</strong> the player leads the most important research &amp; development departments and assembles a strong and motivating management team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do business deals:</strong> The player needs to close transformative business deals to strategically enhance the companies project portfolio/pipeline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make pipeline decisions:</strong> the player needs to optimize the project pipeline by making strategic project and pipeline decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ensure financing:</strong> ensure the financing of your company</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain valuable insights into the <strong>success probabilities of R&amp;D phases</strong>, navigate <strong>business development strategies</strong>, and overcome <strong>financial challenges</strong>. You’ll also learn how <strong>leadership skills</strong> and a strong <strong>organizational culture</strong> are vital for fostering <strong>employee engagement</strong>, boosting <strong>organizational effectiveness</strong>, and achieving overall success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every dashboard you can use the interactive help system to get additional information on drug development, finance and key technical terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun, play and learn!</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "The Pharma R&amp;D Pipeline Manager Game is a round-based educational business and management simulation. Step into the shoes of a Pharma R&amp;D CEO! Lead key research &amp; development units, close transformative deals and optimize your project pipeline. Learn the core principles of drug development.",
